{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3049470/extras/echoes_of_exile_gif3.gif?t=1745092982\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Echoes of Exile</strong> is a short horror game about exploring space caves. You fly to points of interest and delve into the caves with your drone and flashlight. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Send your drone out for recon</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One of the few tools you have is a drone which can fit into places inaccessible to humans. It is a useful tool but not without it's limitations.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3049470/extras/echoes_of_exile_gif1.gif?t=1745092982\" /></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Unravel the truth about what happened in these caves</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3049470/extras/echoes_of_exile_gif2.gif?t=1745092982\" />  </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A short horror experience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3049470/extras/echoes_of_exile_gif4.gif?t=1745092982\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3049470/extras/eoe_wishlist2.png?t=1745092982\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>WISHLIST NOW</strong> to be notified of updates!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3049470?t=1745092982","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3049470?t=1745092982","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/